.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Thresholds bright pixels, blurs them, and composites a glow over a bitmap\&. 
.SH "Constructor & Destructor Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "sl::Bloom::Bloom (\fBBloom\fP && other)\fC [noexcept]\fP"
Transfer ownership of the effect's shaders and render targets\&. 
.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::apply (\fBBitmap\fP * source, int x = \fC0\fP, int y = \fC0\fP, int width = \fC0\fP, int height = \fC0\fP) const"
Apply a wide-area glow to a bitmap region: thresholds bright pixels, downsamples, blurs with a separable Gaussian, then composites the result back over the original at full resolution\&. Texture orientation is resolved by the active backend\&. 
.SS "const std::string & sl::Bloom::error () const"
Return the most recent initialization error\&. 
