Return whether the effect is ready to apply\&. 
.SS "\fBBloom\fP & sl::Bloom::operator= (\fBBloom\fP && other)\fC [noexcept]\fP"
Release this effect's resources and take ownership of another effect's\&. 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::set_downsample (int factor)"
Set how many times smaller the internal blur buffers are than the source (e\&.g\&. 4 blurs at quarter resolution)\&. Bigger values give a wider, softer, cheaper glow; smaller values look tighter and costlier\&. Takes effect on the next \fBapply()\fP call\&. 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::set_intensity (float intensity)"
Set the bloom brightness multiplier\&. 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::set_radius (float radius)"
Set the blur sample spacing, in downsampled-buffer texels\&. 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::set_threshold (float threshold)"
Set the luminance threshold that contributes to bloom\&. 
.SS "void sl::Bloom::shutdown ()"
Release resources owned by the effect\&. 

